WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.268
PRINCE HARRY WITH NEW 
REVELATIONS ABOUT HIS FRACTURED

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:05.705
RELATIONSHIP WITH THE ROYALS.
DURING AN INTERVIEW WITH OUR OWN

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:10.043
ANDERSON COOPER ON "60 MINUTES."
HE TALKED ABOUT THE PHYSICAL

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:14.981
ALTERCATION HE HAD WITH HIS
BROTHER OVER HIS RELATIONSHIP

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:17.183
WITH MEGHAN.
FIRST, I WANT YOU TO TAKE A

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.385
LISTEN TO THIS.
&gt;&gt; HE WAS SHOUTING AT ME.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.788
I WAS SHOUTING BACK AT HIM.
IT WASN'T NICE.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:25.859
IT WASN'T PLEASANT AT ALL, AND
HE SNAPPED, AND HE PUSHED ME TO

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.827
THE FLOOR.
&gt;&gt; HE KNOCKED YOU OVER?

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.630
&gt;&gt; HE KNOCKED ME OVER.
I LANDED ON THE DOG BOWL.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.933
&gt;&gt; YOU CUT YOUR BACK.
&gt;&gt; I CUT MY BACK.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.337
I DIDN'T KNOW IT AT THE TIME.
HE APOLOGIZED AFTERWARDS.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.572
IT WAS A PRETTY NASTY
EXPERIENCE.

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.742
&gt;&gt; DO YOU SPEAK TO WILLIAM NOW?
DO YOU TEXT?

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:48.715
&gt;&gt; CURRENTLY NO.
BUT I LOOK FORWARD TO US BEING

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:52.819
ABLE TO FIND PEACE.
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG HAS IT BEEN SINCE

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.554
YOU SPOKE?
&gt;&gt; A WHILE.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:01:01.261
&gt;&gt; DO YOU SPEAK TO YOUR DAD?
&gt;&gt; WE HAVEN'T SPOKEN FOR QUITE A

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.495
WHILE.
NOT RECENTLY.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:07.767
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU SEE A DAY WHEN YOU
WOULD RETURN AS A FULL-TIME

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.104
MEMBER OF THE ROYAL FAMILY?
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.840
I CAN'T SEE THAT HAPPENING.
&gt;&gt; THAT WAS AN AMAZING

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.577
REVELATION FOR ME.
HE ALSO OPENED UP ABOUT HIS

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:21.781
DECADES' LONG STRUGGLE WITH
GRIEF FOLLOWING THE DEATH OF HIS

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:25.451
MOTHER, PRINCESS DIANA.
THE INTERVIEW WAS THE FIRST

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:27.620
ADVANCE OF THE PUBLICATION OF
HIS BOOK.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.423
THE RELEASE IS ON LINE IN THE
U.S. TONIGHT.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:34.894
JOINING US OUR COLLEAGUE AND WHO
DID THAT INTERVIEW ON "60

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:38.031
MINUTES" OF PRINCE HARRY,
ANDERSON COOPER.

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.866
ANDERSON, GOOD MORNING, GOOD TO
SEE YOU.

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:43.903
SO MANY REVELATIONS HERE.
MY FIRST QUESTION IS WHAT STOOD

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:47.607
OUT TO YOU MOST ABOUT THIS
INTERVIEW?

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.044
MOST REVEALING TO YOU?
&gt;&gt; I READ THE BOOK.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:56.015
IT'S 416 PAGES.
IT'S A VERY NUANCED AND DETAILED

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:58.918
PORTRAIT OF THIS MAN'S LIFE.
I THINK WE ALL GREW UP WATCHING

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.953
HIM.
ALL OF US HAVE SEEN PRINCE HARRY

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:06.226
AND HIS BROTHER FROM THE TIME
THEY WERE BORN, AND WE FEEL LIKE

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.995
WE KNOW WHO THEY ARE.
YET, WHEN YOU READ THE BOOK,

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.831
VERY QUICKLY YOU REALIZE WE
DON'T KNOW THAT MUCH ABOUT

00:02:11.831 --> 00:02:18.137
WHAT'S BEEN GOING ON IN THE
INNER LIFE OF HARRY AND HOW HE

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:24.510
SEES HIMSELF AND HIS
RELATIONSHIP WITH HIS BROTHER

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.312
WHICH HE SAYS IN THE BOOK HAS
BEEN ON A DIFFERENT COURSE SINCE

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.849
THE DEATH OF THEIR MOTHER.
THAT DEATH IS THE CENTRAL EVENT

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.885
OBVIOUSLY IN HARRY'S LIFE.
HE WRITES EXTENSIVELY ABOUT

00:02:32.885 --> 00:02:35.321
THIS.
THIS IS A MEMOIR IN MANY WAYS

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:41.628
ABOUT GRIEF AND LOSS AND THE TRA
JEK

00:02:41.628 --> 00:02:43.263
J
TRAJECTORY AND HOW IT CHANGES

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:45.098
ONE'S LIFE.
&gt;&gt; IT CAME IN FULL CIRCLE.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.667
YOU STARTED THE PIECE WITH
WILLIAM AND HARRY WALKING BEHIND

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.837
THEIR MOTHER'S CASKET AND YOU
ENDED WITH THEM WALKING BEHIND

00:02:50.837 --> 00:02:55.408
THEIR GRANDMOTHER'S CASKET, BUT
HOW CHANGED A RELATIONSHIP THEY

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:57.977
HAD.
OBVIOUSLY WE KNOW, BECAUSE YOU

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:01.914
PUT IT OUT PUBLICLY IN YOUR
PODCAST AND TALKED ABOUT, THE

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:04.651
GRIEF YOU'VE GONE THROUGH WITH
DEATHS IN YOUR OWN FAMILY.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:08.288
I WONDER WHAT IT'S LIKE AS
SOMEONE WHO LOST A PARENT AS A

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:11.124
TEENAGER.
MY DAD DIED A FEW WEEKS BEFORE

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.792
PRINCESS DIANA.
I REMEMBER HER DEATH SO WELL.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:16.162
WHAT IT WAS LIKE FOR YOU TO HEAR
HIM DETAIL HIS GRIEF IN THAT WAY

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:21.234
THAT WE'VE NEVER HEARD PUBLICLY
BEFORE.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:24.937
&gt;&gt; TO ME WHEN I READ THE BOOK, I
AGREED TO DO THIS INTERVIEW

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:28.507
BEFORE I HAD TO CHANCE TO
ACTUALLY READ THE BOOK BECAUSE

00:03:28.507 --> 00:03:31.511
THERE WERE ALL THESE SECURITY
PROTOCOLS TO EVEN GET A COPY OF

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:33.713
THE BOOK.
WHAT JUMPED OUT TO ME IS THIS IS

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:37.016
A STORY OF GRIEF AND LOSS.
IT IS A HUGE PART OF THE BOOK,

00:03:37.016 --> 00:03:42.288
AND IT INFUSES A LOT OF WHAT THE
WAY I THINK PRINCE HARRY SEES

00:03:42.288 --> 00:03:45.858
WHAT IS HAPPENING NOW AND HIS
CONCERNS ABOUT WHAT IS HAPPENING

00:03:45.858 --> 00:03:52.398
NOW, AND I THINK THAT IDEA OF
THE WALK THAT THEY TOOK BEHIND

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:56.235
THEIR MOTHER'S CASKET WHICH WAS
SUCH A FORMATIVE -- IT IS THE

00:03:56.235 --> 00:04:00.973
INDELIBLE IMAGE FROM THE FUNERAL
IN EARLY SEPTEMBER OF 1997, AND

00:04:00.973 --> 00:04:03.809
THAT WALK BEHIND THEIR
GRANDMOTHER'S CASKET.

00:04:03.809 --> 00:04:06.879
IN MANY WAYS IT WAS A SIMILAR
WALK IN THAT THEY WERE TOGETHER,

00:04:06.879 --> 00:04:09.648
BUT THEY WERE APART.
THEY WERE APART BY GRIEF BACK

00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:13.920
WHEN HARRY WAS 12 AND WILLIAM
WAS 15.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.390
HARRY COULDN'T CRY ABOUT IT
UNTIL HIS MOTHER WAS ACTUALLY

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.525
BURIED.
HE COULDN'T EVEN TALK ABOUT IT

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:23.629
REALLY WITH ANYONE FOR MUCH OF
HIS LIFE, AND HE HAD THIS SORT

00:04:23.629 --> 00:04:29.202
OF MAGICAL THINKING IN THE YEARS
AFTER SHE DIED EVEN UP UNTIL HIS

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:33.005
EARLY 20s THAT HE THOUGHT MAYBE
SHE WAS STILL ALIVE.

00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:36.008
IT'S NOT THAT HE THOUGHT SHE HAD
FAKED HER DEATH.

00:04:36.008 --> 00:04:40.113
IT'S JUST HE THOUGHT -- IT WAS
SORT OF A MAGICAL THINKING WHICH

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:43.716
OCCURS WITH MANY PEOPLE WHO HAVE
LOST SOMEBODY, IMAGINING THAT

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:47.653
MAYBE THEY'RE STILL OUT THERE,
THINKING YOU SEE THEM IN PLACES.

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:50.456
THAT'S SOMETHING THAT HE
BELIEVED AND HE SAYS HE HAD

00:04:50.456 --> 00:04:52.392
DISCUSSIONS WITH HIS BROTHER
ABOUT AS WELL.

00:04:52.392 --> 00:04:54.394
&gt;&gt; I THINK WE HAVE THAT MOMENT
IN THE INTERVIEW.

00:04:54.394 --> 00:05:01.300
IT REALLY STOOD OUT.
&gt;&gt; YOU DIDN'T BELIEVE SHE WAS

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.003
DEAD.
&gt;&gt; FOR A LONG TIME.

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:06.238
I JUST REFUSED TO ACCEPT THAT
SHE WAS GONE.

00:05:06.238 --> 00:05:10.410
PART OF -- SHE WOULD NEVER DO
THIS TO US, BUT ALSO PART OF

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.712
MAYBE THIS IS ALL PART OF A
PLAN.

00:05:12.712 --> 00:05:15.948
&gt;&gt; YOU REALLY BELIEVED THAT
MAYBE SHE HAD DECIDED TO

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:18.784
DISAPPEAR FOR A TIME.
&gt;&gt; FOR A TIME AND SHE WOULD CALL

00:05:18.784 --> 00:05:20.953
US AND WE WOULD COME AND JOIN
HER.

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:23.089
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG DID YOU BELIEVE
THAT?

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:25.958
&gt;&gt; YEARS.
MANY, MANY YEARS.

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.261
WILLIAM AND I TALKED ABOUT IT AS
WELL.

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.596
HE HAD SIMILAR THOUGHTS.
&gt;&gt; YOU WRITE IN THE BOOK, YOU

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:34.500
SAY I'D OFTEN SAY IT TO MYSELF
FIRST THING IN THE MORNING,

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:39.172
MAYBE THIS IS THE DAY.
MAYBE THIS IS THE DAY SHE WOULD

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:40.807
REAPPEAR.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, HOPE.

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:44.243
I HAD HUGE AMOUNTS OF HOPE.
&gt;&gt; ANDERSON, ONE THING HE TOLD

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:47.313
YOU WAS HE STRUGGLED TO EVEN
TALK ABOUT IT REALLY TO OTHER

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:50.249
PEOPLE, ABOUT HER DEATH.
DID YOU GET A SENSE OF WHY HE'S

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:53.686
TALKING NOW AND WHY HE GAVE SUCH
AN IN DEPTH INTERVIEW TO YOU?

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:57.256
&gt;&gt; WELL, I MEAN, LOOK, THERE'S A
LOT OF DIFFERENT WAYS TO LOOK AT

00:05:57.256 --> 00:06:01.060
THAT AND A LOT OF IT DEPENDS ON
WHAT YOU THINK ABOUT PRINCE

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:05.765
HARRY PROBABLY AND HIS WIFE
MEGHAN.

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:09.302
HE WILL SAY I HAVE BEEN SILENT
FOR MY ENTIRE LIFE.

00:06:09.302 --> 00:06:12.672
I'VE HAD ENDLESS STORIES WRITTEN
ABOUT ME AND PEOPLE PROJECTING

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:15.508
THINGS ON TO ME AND SAYING
THINGS ABOUT ME, AND THIS IS AN

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:19.612
OPPORTUNITY FOR ME TO ACTUALLY
TALK ABOUT WHO I AM AND HOW I

00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:24.050
SEE THINGS AND THE CENTRAL ROLL
THAT MY MOTHER'S DEATH HAS

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.886
PLAYED IN HIS LIFE.
OBVIOUSLY CRITICS OF HIS WILL

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:32.158
LOOK AND SAY, LOOK, HE AND HIS
WIFE HAVE LEFT THE ROYAL FAMILY.

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:36.128
THEY HAVE BEEN ACCUSED OF
CASHING IN ON THEIR ROYAL

00:06:36.128 --> 00:06:39.932
TITLES.
THEY ARE NOT JUST TELLING THEIR

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.534
STORY.
THEY'RE MAKING ACCUSATIONS

00:06:41.534 --> 00:06:44.036
AGAINST MEMBERS OF THE ROYAL
FAMILY WHICH IS PART OF THEIR

00:06:44.036 --> 00:06:47.874
STORY AS WELL, THEY WOULD SAY.
SO OBVIOUSLY PEOPLE ARE GOING TO

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:51.777
SEE IT DIFFERENT WAYS.
OBVIOUSLY THIS IS PART OF A

00:06:51.777 --> 00:06:55.681
MULTI-BOOK DEAL THAT HARRY
SIGNED WITH PENGUIN RANDOM

00:06:55.681 --> 00:06:57.350
HOUSE.
THERE WAS THE NETFLIX SERIES

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:01.654
WHICH DETAILS MORE OF THE
FRACTURE WITH THE ROYAL FAMILY

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:07.226
AND THEIR LIVES AS A COUPLE I.
THINK THE BOOK, THOUGH -- THE

00:07:07.226 --> 00:07:11.130
FOCUS FOR MOST PEOPLE ON THE
BOOK, OBVIOUSLY, ARE THE

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:14.066
REVELATIONS OF THE DRAMA GOING
ON BE LINED THE SCENES AND THE

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:16.168
ACCUSATIONS BACK AND FORTH.
WHEN YOU READ THE BOOK, THOUGH,

00:07:16.168 --> 00:07:21.307
IT IS VERY MUCH A MEMOIR OF THIS
PERSON'S LIFE, AND THE FULL ARC

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:27.547
OF THEIR LIFE AND REALLY A STORY
OF GRIEF AND EARLY CHILDHOOD

00:07:27.547 --> 00:07:33.619
TRAUMA.
&gt;&gt; ANDERSON, BEFORE YOU GO --

00:07:33.619 --> 00:07:37.123
POPPY TALKED ABOUT YOU LOSING A
FAMILY MEMBER.

00:07:37.123 --> 00:07:40.960
I LOST MY DAD, MY SISTER, MY
GRANDMA.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:45.531
&gt;&gt; IN THE SAME YEAR, RIGHT?
&gt;&gt; IT'S INTERESTING BECAUSE YOU

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:49.101
NEVER GET THOSE PEOPLE BACK, BUT
HE STILL HAS HIS BROTHER IN HIS

00:07:49.101 --> 00:07:51.437
LIFE.
THAT WAS THE SAD PART FOR ME,

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:54.206
WHEN HE SAID I DON'T THINK I'LL
EVER BE A MEMBER OF THE ROYAL

00:07:54.206 --> 00:07:57.877
FAMILY AGAIN, WHICH TRANSLATED
TO ME, I DON'T THINK I CAN REAL

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.146
THIS RIFT.
I HOPE THEY CAN.

00:08:00.146 --> 00:08:03.849
HIS BROTHER IS STILL HERE.
&gt;&gt; HE ACTUALLY SAYS -- HE WOULD

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:07.887
MAKE A DISTINCTION.
THE QUESTION FOR HIM WAS REALLY

00:08:07.887 --> 00:08:12.658
A PUBLIC -- A SENIOR ROLE IN THE
ROYAL FAMILY, LIVING IN ENGLAND,

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:16.762
WORKING FULL TIME FOR THE ROYAL
FAMILY AS HE WAS, THAT HE

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:20.299
DOESN'T SEE HAPPENING.
HE CERTAINLY HOLDS OUT THE

00:08:20.299 --> 00:08:23.636
POSSIBILITY OF A PARTIAL ROLE
CONTINUED IN THE ROYAL FAMILY.

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:29.775
HE SAYS THAT THE OFFER THAT WAS
MADE TO -- THIS IS NOT -- THIS

00:08:29.775 --> 00:08:32.845
CAME OUT IN THE INTERVIEW, WE
DIDN'T INCLUDE IT IN THE PIECE,

00:08:32.845 --> 00:08:36.349
BUT JUST FOR TIME.
BUT HE SAYS THAT A PARTIAL ROLE

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:39.251
IS STILL ON THE TABLE.
THE ORIGINAL OFFER WHICH WAS

00:08:39.251 --> 00:08:45.591
LIVING OVERSEAS FOR A CERTAIN
AMOUNT OF MONTHS A YEAR AND THEN

00:08:45.591 --> 00:08:49.395
FULFILLING DUTIES FOR THE ROYAL
FAMILY FOR PART TIME OF THE

00:08:49.395 --> 00:08:51.731
YEAR, THAT IS STILL ON THE
TABLE.

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:56.035
THERE WOULD STILL NEED TO BE A
NUMBER OF CONVERSATIONS AND

00:08:56.035 --> 00:08:58.170
DISCUSSIONS AND FRANK
DISCUSSIONS THAT DON'T LEAK OUT

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.940
BEFORE THAT WOULD HAPPEN.
SO HE HOLDS OUT.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:04.209
HE CERTAINLY SAYS HE WANTS A
RELATIONSHIP WITH -- HE LOVES

00:09:04.209 --> 00:09:07.546
HIS BROTHER, LOVES HIS FATHER.
HE SAYS HE WANTS A RELATIONSHIP

00:09:07.546 --> 00:09:14.453
WITH ALL OF THEM.
OBVIOUSLY THAT'S MAYBE EVEN MORE

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:18.758
DIFFICULT TO IMAGINE RIGHT NOW
GIVEN THE REVELATIONS HE HAS

00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:23.629
BROUGHT FORTH.
BUT HE SAYS HE'S NOT DOING IT IN

00:09:23.629 --> 00:09:27.767
A HURTFUL MANNER, AND HE VERY
MUCH WOULD LIKE TO HAVE A

00:09:27.767 --> 00:09:28.668
DIALOGUE.

